menu "DermEdge network"

    config DERMEDGE_WIFI_SSID
        string "WiFi name (SSID)"
        default "DermEdge"
        help
            The network the laptop hub is on -- e.g. the laptop's own hotspot, so nothing
            touches the internet.

    config DERMEDGE_WIFI_PASSWORD
        string "WiFi password"
        default "changeme123"

    config DERMEDGE_HUB_URL
        string "Hub URL (no trailing slash)"
        default "http://192.168.2.1:8000"
        help
            Where app/server.py runs: http://<laptop IP on that network>:8000. On macOS the IP is in
            System Settings > Wi-Fi > Details; on a macOS hotspot (Internet Sharing) it is
            usually 192.168.2.1.

endmenu
